  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to hide your identity increases greatly.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> No Name<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus on Bluff checks increases by 2, and your bonus on Disguise checks when you spend a grit point increases by 5. In addition, you can expend one use of mythic power to treat a Disguise check as if you had rolled a natural 20. You must decide to use this ability before making the roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-grit-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
